        "description": {
          "text": "Labeling update adding long-term duration of response and overall response rate follow-up data for BRAF V600E-positive metastatic NSCLC; no new indication (fulfilled postmarketing commitment).",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application revises the CLINICAL STUDIES, BRAF V600E Mutation-Positive Metastatic Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer (14.4) subsection with additional follow-up for duration of response (DOR) in patients who received dabrafenib as a single agent or in combination with trametinib and were considered responders in Study BRF113928 at the time of the initial approval. Additionally, the overall response rate (ORR) results and categorizations of best overall response were updated for patients who were previously treated and received dabrafenib in combination with trametinib. Similarly, the categorizations of best overall response were updated for patients who were treatment-na\u00efve prior to receiving dabrafenib in combination with trametinib.",
